#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
msgid ""
"Oh, well I took a job here about a year before <the_cataclysm>, and I was "
"living alone when things got bad and I thought I might be safer here with "
"work friends.  My friends Beatrice and Ross and I got some supplies ready and"
" then more people started to join us.  And then it got bad.  But I think that"
" has settled down some now."
msgstr ""

